      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure why you want to keep `PLDM_RDE_TRANSFER_FLAG_MAX`?\nI don\u0027t see DSP0218 define such properties either.\n\nPlease acknowledge us why would you insist to keep them here.\nThanks!",
